# Wait for login, then continue

When blocked on human login/OAuth/passkey/admin toggle:

1. Exhaust API/CLI/tokens/Edge first.
2. Open exact URL(s), tell user briefly, **poll until success** — do not abandon.
3. Resume immediately after success — no “should I continue?”.
4. Prefer external Edge for passkeys (Cursor Browser often hangs).
5. Settings/MCP cleanup with no human click → `do-it-yourself-settings` / DIY always.
